<title>USA: Comsat to spin off Ascent June 27.</title>
<headline>Comsat to spin off Ascent June 27.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comsat is completing its spin-off to shareholders of its 80.67 percent stake in Ascent Entertainment Group Inc on June 27, the companies said in separate statements.</p>
<p>Comsat declared a special dividend of its Ascent shares to Comsat shareholders for shareholders of record as of June 19, the companies said.</p>
<p>The distribution of Ascent stock will be made on a pro rata basis with Comsat shareholders receiving approximately one-half share of Ascent stock for each share of Comsat stock held, the companies said.</p>
<p>Comsat owns 24 million of Ascent's 29.8 million shares.</p>
